# Stoneworks (Fabricator): burns wood to make stone ("Fabricator fuel/s" in, "Fabricator minerals/s" out), with
# workers and no light. A 4x4x4 m box (2x2 cells). Spawned origin 2.0 above ground.
# SHAPE (uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): a MASONS' YARD - a stone floor (the root), a plastered kiln
# house with a slate roof, a brick chimney through the roof, a furnace mouth in the front wall, a saw bench with a
# block on it, a stack of cut blocks and a pile of logs. The child pieces are render-only.
